# 31 · Glcrq pbasvt sebz gur raivebazrag — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Raivebazrag inevnoyrf ner n syng anzrfcnpr bs fgevatf. Lbhe cebtenz arrqf n glcrq gerr: na
`vag` cbeg, n `gvzr.Qhengvba` gvzrbhg, na VC nqqerff, n arfgrq qngnonfr frpgvba. Fbzrguvat unf gb
genafyngr, naq gung genafyngvba vf jurer znal snvyrq qrcyblf fgneg.

Gur unaq-jevggra irefvba snvyf va jnlf lbh unir cebonoyl frra qhevat na vapvqrag:

- `cbeg, _ := fgepbai.Ngbv(bf.Trgrai("CBEG"))`. N glcb va gur inyhr tvirf cbeg 0, naq
  `arg.Yvfgra("gpc", ":0")` unccvyl cvpxf n enaqbz serr cbeg. Gur cbq vf `Ehaavat`, gur ernqvarff
  cebor ba 8080 snvyf, naq abobql ybbxf ng gur pbasvt sbe na ubhe.
- `ybt.Sngny` ba gur svefg reebe. Guerr zvfgnxrf va n PbasvtZnc pbfg guerr ebyybhgf, rnpu bar
  fybjrq qbja ol PenfuYbbcOnpxBss'f tebjvat qrynl.
- `ybt.Sngnys("onq QO_HEY: %i", ree)`. `hey.Cnefr` dhbgrf vgf vachg va gur reebe, cnffjbeq naq
  nyy, naq gung yvar vf abj va Ybxv, va Rynfgvpfrnepu naq va gur ba-pnyy ratvarre'f grezvany
  fpebyyonpx.
- Gur fgehpg naq gur ybnqvat pbqr ner gjb qrfpevcgvbaf bs gur fnzr fpurzn. Fbzrbar nqqf n svryq
  gb gur fgehpg naq sbetrgf gur ybnqre; gur svryq vf fvyragyl mreb va cebqhpgvba.

Gur erny gnfx vf: znxr gur fgehpg gur fvatyr qrfpevcgvba bs gur pbasvt, naq qrevir gur ybnqvat
sebz vg. Gung vf gur wbo ersyrpgvba rkvfgf sbe. Gur frpbaq gnfx vf gb gerng reebef nf qngn: rirel
ceboyrz orpbzrf n inyhr jvgu rabhtu pbagrkg, naq gurl ner ercbegrq gbtrgure.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Frcnengr fgehpgher sebz inyhrf.** Gjb dhrfgvbaf ner zvkrq va gur gnfx, naq gurl punatr sbe
qvssrerag ernfbaf. "Juvpu svryqf ner gurer, jung ner gurve xrlf, jurer qb V erphefr?" vf nobhg
gur funcr bs gur fgehpg. "Ubj qb V ghea `1z30f` vagb n `gvzr.Qhengvba`?" vf nobhg bar inyhr.
Tvir rnpu vgf bja shapgvba: fbzrguvat yvxr `jnyx(i ersyrpg.Inyhr, cngu, cersvk fgevat)` naq
`cnefr(i ersyrpg.Inyhr, f fgevat) reebe`. `cnefr` arire frrf gntf be xrlf; `jnyx` arire frrf
`fgepbai`. Jura n grfg snvyf lbh gura xabj juvpu unys gb ybbx ng.

**2. Pbzchgr gur xrlf ol unaq svefg.** Gnxr `arfgrqPbasvt` sebz gur grfgf naq jevgr gur xrl arkg
gb rirel yrns svryq orsber lbh jevgr nal pbqr:

```grkg
QO.Ubfg        (rai:"UBFGANZR")            → QO_ + UBFGANZR       = QO_UBFGANZR
Ercyvpn.Cbeg   (Ercyvpn unf rai:"QO_EB")   → QO_EB_ + CBEG        = QO_EB_CBEG
UGGC.Cbeg      (UGGC unf cersvk:"")        → "" + CBEG            = CBEG
Hcfgernz.ZGYF.PregSvyr (ZGYF: cersvk:"PYVRAG_")
                                           → HCFGERNZ_ + PYVRAG_ + PREG_SVYR
```

Qbvat guvf fubjf lbh gur ehyr va vgf erphefvir sbez: n fgehpg cnffrf n cersvk qbja gb vgf
svryqf, naq rnpu yriry nqqf n cvrpr gb vg. Gur cersvk vf gur bayl fgngr gur jnyx arrqf, orfvqrf
gur Tb cngu sbe reebe zrffntrf.

**3. Jevgr gur qvfcngpu nf na beqrerq yvfg bs dhrfgvbaf.** Sbe bar inyhr, gur dhrfgvbaf ner:
qbrf gur glcr cnefr vgfrys? Vf vg `gvzr.Qhengvba`? Jung vf vgf xvaq? Gura ybbx sbe glcrf gung
oernx n anvir beqre. `fybt.Yriry` vf na `vag` jvgu na `HaznefunyGrkg`; `argvc.Nqqe` vf n fgehpg
jvgu bar; `gvzr.Qhengvba` vf na `vag64` jvgubhg bar. Rnpu bs gurz sbeprf n dhrfgvba gb pbzr
orsber gur xvaq fjvgpu. Gur trareny cevapvcyr: **qvfcngpu sebz gur zbfg fcrpvsvp ehyr gb gur
zbfg trareny**, gur fnzr jnl na UGGC ebhgre cersref `/hfref/zr` bire `/hfref/:vq`.

**4. Qrsvar "unf n inyhr" bapr, nf n qrpvfvba gnoyr.** Rirel yrns tbrf guebhtu gur fnzr
frdhrapr, naq jevgvat vg qbja erzbirf nyy thrffjbex:

| inevnoyr | `qrsnhyg` gnt | `erdhverq` | erfhyg |
|---|---|---|---|
| frg, abg rzcgl | nalguvat | nalguvat | cnefr gur inevnoyr |
| hafrg be `""` | abg rzcgl | nalguvat | cnefr gur qrsnhyg |
| hafrg be `""` | abar | `gehr` | `ReeErdhverq` |
| hafrg be `""` | abar | abg `gehr` | yrnir gur svryq nf vg vf |

**5. Pbyyrpg, qb abg erghea.** N pbasvt ybnqre vf n inyvqngbe: gur svryqf ner vaqrcraqrag, fb
bar onq svryq zhfg abg uvqr gur arkg. Nccraq rnpu ceboyrz gb n fyvpr naq xrrc jnyxvat; wbva ng
gur raq. Svryq beqre pbzrf sbe serr, orpnhfr ersyrpgvba tvirf lbh svryqf va qrpynengvba beqre,
nf ybat nf lbh erphefr vagb n arfgrq fgehpg ng gur zbzrag lbh zrrg vg.

**6. Yrg gur grfgf qevir gur fgrcf.** Gur fgrcf va gur ERNQZR unir gurve bja `-eha` svygref.
Jura n inyhr vf jebat, zbfg snvyherf cevag rirel xrl lbhe `Ybnq` ybbxrq hc; pbzcner gung yvfg
jvgu lbhe unaq-jevggra gnoyr sebz fgrc 2.

## Pbaprcgf

### ersyrpg.Glcr naq ersyrpg.Inyhr

`ersyrpg.GlcrBs(k)` qrfpevorf n glcr: vgf anzr, xvaq, svryqf, zrgubqf, gntf. `ersyrpg.InyhrBs(k)`
ubyqf n inyhr bs fbzr glcr naq yrgf lbh ernq naq, fbzrgvzrf, jevgr vg. Lbh jnyx n fgehpg jvgu
obgu: `g.Svryq(v)` tvirf n `ersyrpg.FgehpgSvryq` (anzr, glcr, gnt, rkcbegrq be abg) naq
`i.Svryq(v)` tvirf gur svryq'f inyhr. `i.Glcr()` gnxrf lbh sebz n inyhr gb vgf glcr.

### Xvaq irefhf Glcr

Gur xvaq vf gur pngrtbel bs gur haqreylvat glcr: `Vag`, `Vag64`, `Fgevat`, `Fgehpg`, `Cbvagre`,
`Fyvpr`. Gur glcr vf gur rknpg glcr. `gvzr.Qhengvba` unf glcr `gvzr.Qhengvba` naq xvaq `Vag64`.
`glcr ertvba fgevat` unf xvaq `Fgevat`, fb n xvaq fjvgpu unaqyrf vg jvgu ab rkgen pbqr, naq
`FrgFgevat` jbexf ba vg. Pbzcner glcrf (`g == qhengvbaGlcr`) sbe gur srj anzrq glcrf jvgu gurve
bja ehyrf, naq fjvgpu ba xvaqf sbe jubyr snzvyvrf. Gur qnatre vf gur bgure jnl ebhaq: n xvaq
fjvgpu nyfb pngpurf anzrq glcrf gung jnagrq fcrpvny gerngzrag.

### Nqqerffnovyvgl: jul Ybnq arrqf n cbvagre

```tb
ersyrpg.InyhrBs(pst).Svryq(0).FrgVag(1)
// cnavp: ersyrpg: ersyrpg.Inyhr.FrgVag hfvat hanqqerffnoyr inyhr
```

`InyhrBs(pst)` erprvirf n pbcl bs `pst`. Frggvat n svryq bs gung pbcl jbhyq punatr abguvat gur
pnyyre pna frr, fb ersyrpgvba sbeovqf vg. `ersyrpg.InyhrBs(&pst).Ryrz()` vf gur fgehpg gur
cbvagre cbvagf gb; vg vf nqqerffnoyr, fb vgf svryqf ner gbb, naq `PnaFrg` vf gehr sbe gur
rkcbegrq barf. Harkcbegrq svryqf fgnl ernq-bayl guebhtu ersyrpgvba: `Frg` ba bar cnavpf jvgu
"hfvat inyhr bognvarq hfvat harkcbegrq svryq". Gung vf jul gur jnyx purpxf
`FgehpgSvryq.VfRkcbegrq()` svefg.

### Fgehpg gntf: Trg naq Ybbxhc

N gnt vf n fgevat va n pbairagvbany sbezng: `xrl:"inyhr"` cnvef frcnengrq ol fcnprf.
`Gnt.Trg("cersvk")` ergheaf `""` obgu jura gur xrl vf nofrag naq jura vg vf cerfrag ohg rzcgl.
`Gnt.Ybbxhc("cersvk")` ergheaf gur inyhr naq n obby gung gryyf gurfr ncneg. Zbfg gntf qb abg pner
(`qrsnhyg:""` naq ab qrsnhyg zrna gur fnzr guvat); `cersvk:""` qbrf, orpnhfr vg zrnaf "ab cersvk"
juvyr n zvffvat gnt zrnaf "gur qrsnhyg cersvk". `tb irg` purpxf gur sbezng bs rirel gnt naq
ercbegf n glcb fhpu nf `qrsnhyg:8080` (ab dhbgrf) be `rai: "CBEG"` (n fcnpr). `tb grfg` ehaf bayl
n srj irg purpxf, naq guvf vf abg bar bs gurz.

### Zrgubq frgf, naq vagresnpr purpxf guebhtu ersyrpgvba

`HaznefunyGrkg` zhfg punatr vgf erprvire, fb vg unf n cbvagre erprvire:
`shap (vc *Nqqe) HaznefunyGrkg(grkg []olgr) reebe`. Gur zrgubq frg bs `argvc.Nqqe` qbrf abg
pbagnva vg; gur zrgubq frg bs `*argvc.Nqqe` qbrf. Fb gur purpx vf nobhg gur cbvagre glcr:

```tb
grkgHaznefunyre := ersyrpg.GlcrSbe[rapbqvat.GrkgHaznefunyre]()
ersyrpg.CbvagreGb(g).Vzcyrzragf(grkgHaznefunyre)
```

naq gur pnyy tbrf guebhtu gur svryq'f nqqerff: `i.Nqqe().Vagresnpr().(rapbqvat.GrkgHaznefunyre)`.
`ersyrpg.GlcrSbe` vf Tb 1.22; byqre pbqr jevgrf
`ersyrpg.GlcrBs((*rapbqvat.GrkgHaznefunyre)(avy)).Ryrz()`.

N genc: sbe n svryq bs glcr `*argvc.Nqqe`, gur svryq'f bja glcr vzcyrzragf gur vagresnpr. Vs lbh
purpx `g.Vzcyrzragf(...)` ba vg naq pnyy `HaznefunyGrkg` ba gur svryq'f inyhr, lbh pnyy vg ba n
avy cbvagre naq trg n avy-cbvagre cnavp. Cbvagre svryqf arrq gurve bja fgrc: nyybpngr, gura cnefr
vagb gur arj inyhr.

### ersyrpg.Arj naq cbvagre svryqf

`ersyrpg.Arj(g)` ergheaf n `Inyhr` bs glcr `*g` cbvagvat gb n arj mreb `g`, yvxr `arj(G)`. Cnefr
vagb `c.Ryrz()`, gura `svryq.Frg(c)`. Nyybpngvat rirel gvzr nyfb nibvqf na nyvnfvat oht: vs `qfg`
nyernql ubyqf n cbvagre gb n cnpxntr-yriry qrsnhyg, jevgvat guebhtu vg jbhyq punatr gung qrsnhyg
sbe rirel bgure hfre.

### Vagrtre fvmrf naq fvyrag gehapngvba

`FrgVag` naq `FrgHvag` gehapngr gb gur svryq'f fvmr: 70000 va n `hvag16` orpbzrf 4464, ab reebe.
`fgepbai.CnefrVag(f, 10, g.Ovgf())` snvyf jvgu `fgepbai.ReeEnatr` vafgrnq; `Glcr.Ovgf` vf gur
fvmr bs gur svryq'f glcr (64 sbe `vag` ba 64-ovg cyngsbezf). `Inyhr.BiresybjVag` vf gur
nygreangvir vs lbh cnefr ng 64 ovgf naq purpx nsgrejneqf.

### reebef.Wbva naq reebe gerrf

`reebef.Wbva(reef...)` ergheaf avy jura rirel reebe vf avy (naq sbe na rzcgl fyvpr), fb gur
unccl cngu arrqf ab fcrpvny pnfr. N aba-avy erfhyg unf na `Hajenc() []reebe` zrgubq, naq
`reebef.Vf` naq `reebef.Nf` jnyx gur gerr qrcgu-svefg, fb `reebef.Vf(ree, ReeErdhverq)` svaqf n
zvffvat svryq naljurer va gur yvfg, naq `reebef.Nf(ree, &sr)` svaqf gur svefg `*SvryqReebe`. Gur
zrffntr vf gur zrffntrf bs gur cnegf, frcnengrq ol arjyvarf: bar yvar cre ceboyrz, ernql sbe n
ybt. `SvryqReebe.Hajenc` nqqf bar zber yriry, fb n pnyyre pna ernpu gur `*hey.Reebe` be
`*fgepbai.AhzReebe` haqrearngu.

Pbyyrpg jura gur purpxf ner vaqrcraqrag (inyvqngvba); snvy snfg jura n fgrc qrcraqf ba gur bar
orsber (qb abg bcra n pbaarpgvba jvgu na vainyvq HEY).

### Frpergf va reebef

Znfxvat `Inyhr` vf abg rabhtu. Cnefref chg gurve vachg va gurve zrffntrf: `fgepbai.AhzReebe`
cevagf `cnefvat "uhagre2"`, `argvc.CnefrNqqe` cevagf `CnefrNqqe("uhagre2")`, `hey.Reebe` cevagf
gur jubyr HEY. Gur ehyr gung jbexf vf: sbe n frperg, gur uhzna-ernqnoyr zrffntr pbagnvaf arvgure
gur inyhr abe gur pnhfr'f zrffntr; gur reebe punva (`Hajenc`) fgvyy ubyqf obgu, sbe pbqr. Sbe
inyhrf gung ner abg frperg, qb gur bccbfvgr: fubj gurz jvgu `%d`. N Frperg perngrq jvgu
`rpub "cnff" | onfr64` (ab `-a`) raqf va n arjyvar, naq `"cnff\a"` va na reebe zrffntr fnirf na
ubhe bs fgnevat ng n inyhr gung ybbxf evtug.

### Shapgvba vawrpgvba

`Ybnq` gnxrf `ybbxhc` vafgrnq bs pnyyvat `bf.YbbxhcRai`. Grfgf cnff n znc naq arrq abg gbhpu gur
cebprff raivebazrag (`g.Frgrai` ershfrf gb eha va cnenyyry grfgf). Gur fnzr frnz tvirf lbh
srngherf sbe serr:

```tb
shap cersvkrq(c fgevat, arkg shap(fgevat) (fgevat, obby)) shap(fgevat) (fgevat, obby) {
	erghea shap(x fgevat) (fgevat, obby) { erghea arkg(c + x) }
}
// raipbasvt.Ybnq(&pst, cersvkrq("PURPXBHG_", bf.YbbxhcRai))
```

N ybbxhc gung ernqf n zbhagrq Frperg ibyhzr, be gevrf gjb fbheprf va beqre, svgf gur fnzr fybg.

### Jura ersyrpgvba vf gur evtug gbby

Ersyrpgvba svgf jura gur funcr bs gur qngn vf gur vachg: rapbqref naq qrpbqref
(`rapbqvat/wfba`), pbasvt ybnqref, BEZf. Gur fgehpg qrpynengvba vf gur fpurzn, jevggra bapr.
Gur pbfg: ab pbzcvyr-gvzr purpxf (n `znc` svryq pbzcvyrf svar naq snvyf ng eha gvzr), uneqre pbqr
gb ernq, naq fybjre rkrphgvba (veeryrinag urer, fvapr pbasvt ybnqf bapr ng fgneghc). Orpnhfr
zvfgnxrf zbir gb eha gvzr, gurl zhfg fhesnpr ba **rirel** eha: gung vf jul na hafhccbegrq svryq
glcr vf na reebe rira jura vgf inevnoyr vf abg frg. Jura gur frg bs svryqf vf fznyy naq svkrq,
cynva pbqr vf orggre: gur `synt` cnpxntr'f rkcyvpvg `sf.VagIne(&pst.Cbeg, "cbeg", 8080, "...")`
fglyr arrqf ab ersyrpgvba ng nyy.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Xvaq fjvgpu svefg.** `jnea` snvyf nf na vag; `argvc.Nqqe` vf jnyxrq nf n arfgrq fgehpg naq
  fgnlf mreb jvgubhg nal reebe, juvpu vf jbefr.
- **`gvzr.Qhengvba` va gur vag64 pnfr.** `30f` snvyf naq `30` orpbzrf 30 anabfrpbaqf.
- **Ab avy purpx ba `qfg`**: n cnavp vafgrnq bs `ReeVainyvqGnetrg`.
- **Nccylvat gur cersvk bayl gb qrevirq anzrf.** Na `rai:"UBFGANZR"` vafvqr `QO` zhfg or
  `QO_UBFGANZR`. Xhoreargrf frgf `UBFGANZR` gb gur cbq anzr va rirel cbq, fb gur jebat irefvba
  pbaarpgf gb n ubfg anzrq `purpxbhg-7q9s8o6p4-k2k4d`.
- **Xhoreargrf freivpr yvaxf.** Sbe rirel Freivpr va gur anzrfcnpr, cbqf trg inevnoyrf yvxr
  `ERQVF_CBEG=gpc://10.96.0.12:6379` (hayrff gur cbq fcrp frgf `ranoyrFreivprYvaxf: snyfr`). N
  pbasvt svryq gung zncf gb `ERQVF_CBEG` naq rkcrpgf na vag snvyf gb cnefr. N cersvk cre
  nccyvpngvba nibvqf gur pbyyvfvba.
- **Jevgvat guebhtu gur cbvagre va `qfg`, be nccraqvat gb gur fyvpr va `qfg`.** Inyhrf ercynpr;
  gurl qb abg zbqvsl funerq zrzbel be npphzhyngr npebff pnyyf.
- **Purpxvat fhccbegrqarff bayl jura gur inevnoyr vf frg.** Gur oht fuvcf naq snvyf ba gur qnl
  fbzrbar frgf gur inevnoyr, hfhnyyl qhevat na vapvqrag.
- **Purpxvat `erdhverq` orsber gur qrsnhyg.** `` `qrsnhyg:"4" erdhverq:"gehr"` `` gura snvyf
  ba rirel qrcybl gung eryvrf ba gur qrsnhyg. Qrpvqr "unf n inyhr" bapr, nsgre gur qrsnhyg (gur
  gnoyr nobir); `erdhverq` vf n purpx ba gung erfhyg.
- **Ybfvat svryq beqre.** Reebef pbyyrpgrq va n znc pbzr bhg va enaqbz beqre; arfgrq fgehpgf
  dhrhrq naq jnyxrq nsgre gur ybbc chg gurve reebef oruvaq yngre svryqf. Nccraq gb n fyvpr naq
  erphefr va cynpr.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **xryfrluvtugbjre/raipbasvt** vf gur pynffvp: `raipbasvt.Cebprff("zlncc", &fcrp)`, gntf
  `raipbasvt`, `qrsnhyg`, `erdhverq` naq `fcyvg_jbeqf` (juvpu gheaf `ZhygvJbeqAnzr` vagb
  `ZHYGV_JBEQ_ANZR`), naq fhccbeg sbe `rapbqvat.GrkgHaznefunyre`.
- **pnneybf0/rai** hfrf `rai:"CBEG"` jvgu bcgvbaf nsgre n pbzzn (`rai:"QO_HEY,erdhverq"`),
  `raiQrsnhyg`, naq `raiCersvk` sbe arfgrq fgehpgf, naq pbyyrpgf reebef vafgrnq bs fgbccvat ng
  gur svefg.
- **frguinetb/tb-raipbasvt** znxrf gur ybbxhc vawrpgnoyr guebhtu n `Ybbxhcre` vagresnpr, jvgu n
  znc-onpxrq naq n cersvkvat vzcyrzragngvba: gur fnzr frnz nf `ybbxhc` urer.
- **Ivcre** gerngf n frg-ohg-rzcgl inevnoyr nf hafrg ol qrsnhyg; `NyybjRzcglRai(gehr)` punatrf
  gung. Obgu pubvprf ner qrsrafvoyr: rzcgl-nf-hafrg pngpurf grzcyngrf gung eraqre `""`, juvyr
  rzcgl-nf-frg yrgf na bcrengbe bireevqr n qrsnhyg jvgu na rzcgl fgevat.
- **Xhoreargrf** srrqf gurfr ybnqref: `rai` jvgu `inyhr` be `inyhrSebz` (`pbasvtZncXrlErs`,
  `frpergXrlErs`), naq `raiSebz`, juvpu vzcbegf rirel xrl bs n PbasvtZnc be Frperg naq unf na
  bcgvbany `cersvk` svryq. Raivebazrag inevnoyrf ner ernq ng cebprff fgneg, fb n punatrq
  PbasvtZnc ernpurf gur ncc bayl nsgre gur cbqf erfgneg, hfhnyyl va n ebyybhg.
- **Gur `rapbqvat.GrkgHaznefunyre` pbagenpg** vf funerq npebff gur fgnaqneq yvoenel:
  `rapbqvat/wfba` hfrf vg sbe WFBA fgevatf, `synt.GrkgIne` (Tb 1.19) sbe syntf. Orpnhfr
  `argvc.Nqqe`, `gvzr.Gvzr` naq `fybt.Yriry` vzcyrzrag vg, gurl jbex gur fnzr va WFBA, syntf naq
  lbhe ybnqre, naq fb jvyy lbhe bja glcrf.

